cial-corp-wtfc-q3-2018-earnings-conf.aspx"},{"c":"WTFC 2018 Q4","e":"wtfc","d":"2019-01-22","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"David A. Dykstra","x":"So those two things have a little bit of tailwind, the positive pricing you still get a little bit of CD repricing out there as upward pressure but if rates don't move then as Ed said, we think we can sort of hold the increases on the deposits elsewhere pretty well and then the mix change with…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/01/23/wintrust-financial-corp-wtfc-q4-2018-earnings-conf.aspx"},{"c":"WTFC 2018 Q4","e":"wtfc","d":"2019-01-22","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Edward Joseph Wehmer","x":"We continue with our cost cutting and efficiency moves in this business, many of which will be operational by mid-year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/01/23/wintrust-financial-corp-wtfc-q4-2018-earnings-conf.aspx"},{"c":"WTFC 2019 Q1","e":"wtfc","d":"2019-04-16","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Edward Wehmer","x":"We continue with our cost cutting and efficiency progress in this business, many of which will be operational by midyear.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/04/17/wintrust-financial-wtfc-q1-2019-earnings-call-tran.aspx"},{"c":"WTFC 2019 Q1","e":"wtfc","d":"2019-04-16","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Dave Stoehr","x":"You can see if you look at our data processing line, we've had some declines and we're renegotiating some -- a number of different contracts and trying to streamline some of that stuff.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/04/17/wintrust-financial-wtfc-q1-2019-earnings-call-tran.aspx"},{"c":"WTFC 2019 Q2","e":"wtfc","d":"2019-07-16","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Edward Joseph Wehmer","x":"Further, the cost decreases are expected as we will be seeing full quarter benefits of what has been accomplished to date and execute additional cost saving measures in Phase 2 of the pro